DPP_001	Partial subsidy by the state (DPP)	petroleum_dpp	ABS(phase1_total - phase2_total)	DPP = ABS(Phase 1 Total - Phase 2 Total). Informational only. If Phase 2 > Phase 1: Additional charge (state collects). If Phase 1 > Phase 2: Subsidy by the state (state pays). Importer always pays Phase 1 total.	["phase1_total", "phase2_total"]	t	2	2026-01-01	\N	2026-06-15 02:16:18.872222	2026-06-16 05:16:37.458985
ATP_001	Additional Tax on Petroleum product (ATP)	petroleum_atp	volume_liter * atp_rate * exchange_rate	ATP = Additional Tax on Petroleum product. ATP base = LTR (Liter). Rate = .02/L (fixed USD per liter, NOT a percentage). Formula: ATP base x .02 x exchange_rate = ATP Amount in KHR. Rounding: round to whole number, then round UP to nearest 100 (CEILING_100).	["volume_liter", "atp_rate", "exchange_rate"]	t	2	2026-01-01	\N	2026-06-15 02:16:18.872222	2026-06-16 05:16:37.458985
CPP_001	Customs duty on Petroleum Product (CPP)	petroleum_cpp	cpp_base * cpp_rate	CPP = Customs duty on Petroleum Product. Formula: CPP base x cd_rate Rounding: round to whole number, then round UP to nearest 100 (CEILING_100).	["cpp_base", "cpp_rate"]	t	2	2026-01-01	\N	2026-06-15 02:16:18.872222	2026-06-16 05:16:37.458985
CC_001	Currency Conversion	currency_conversion	cif_value * exchange_rate	Convert CIF value from external currency to KHR using official MEF rate	["cif_value", "exchange_rate"]	t	2	2026-01-01	\N	2026-06-11 08:35:55.188124	2026-06-15 02:24:38.673353
COP_001	Customs duty on Other Products (COP)	cop_amount	customs_value * duty_rate	COP = Customs duty on Other Products. Formula: Customs Value x cd_rate	["customs_value", "duty_rate"]	t	2	2026-01-01	\N	2026-06-15 02:16:18.872222	2026-06-15 02:24:38.673353
FTA_COP	FTA Customs duty on Other Products (COP)	fta_cop	customs_value * cd_rate	FTA COP: uses the actual preferential cd_rate from the DB. Rate may be 0% or reduced - never hardcoded to zero.	["customs_value", "cd_rate"]	t	2	2026-01-01	\N	2026-06-15 02:16:18.872222	2026-06-15 02:24:38.673353
SOP_001	Special tax on Other Products (SOP)	sop_amount	(customs_value + cop_amount) * special_tax_rate	SOP = Special tax on Other Products. Base = Customs Value + COP Amount	["customs_value", "cop_amount", "special_tax_rate"]	t	2	2026-01-01	\N	2026-06-15 02:16:18.872222	2026-06-15 02:24:38.673353
TDT_001	Total Duties and Taxes	total_duties_and_taxes	cop_amount + sop_amount + vop_amount	Sum all duty and tax components	["cop_amount", "sop_amount", "vop_amount"]	t	2	2026-01-01	\N	2026-06-11 08:35:55.211624	2026-06-15 02:24:38.673353
TP_001	Total Payable	total_payable	total_duties_and_taxes + processing_fee + inspection_fee + other_fees	Final amount payable including all duties, taxes, and fees	["total_duties_and_taxes", "processing_fee", "inspection_fee", "other_fees"]	t	2	2026-01-01	\N	2026-06-11 08:35:55.214765	2026-06-15 02:24:38.673353
VOP_001	VAT on Other Products (VOP)	vop_amount	(customs_value + cop_amount + sop_amount) * vat_rate if sop_amount > 0 else (customs_value + cop_amount) * vat_rate	VOP = VAT on Other Products. Base includes SOP if SOP > 0, otherwise Customs Value + COP	["customs_value", "cop_amount", "sop_amount", "vat_rate"]	t	2	2026-01-01	\N	2026-06-15 02:16:18.872222	2026-06-15 02:24:38.673353
SPP_001	Special tax on Petroleum Product (SPP)	petroleum_spp	(cpp_base + cpp_amount + atp_amount) * spp_rate	SPP = Special tax on Petroleum Product. SPP base = CPP base + CPP + ATP. Rounding: round to whole number, then round UP to nearest 100 (CEILING_100).	["cpp_base", "cpp_amount", "atp_amount", "spp_rate"]	t	2	2026-01-01	\N	2026-06-15 02:16:18.872222	2026-06-16 05:16:37.458985
VPP_001	VAT on Petroleum Product (VPP)	petroleum_vpp	(cpp_base + cpp_amount + atp_amount + spp_amount) * vat_rate	VPP = VAT on Petroleum Product. VPP base = CPP base + CPP + ATP + SPP (NOT spp_base + spp_amount). Rounding: round to whole number, then round UP to nearest 100 (CEILING_100).	["cpp_base", "cpp_amount", "atp_amount", "spp_amount", "vat_rate"]	t	2	2026-01-01	\N	2026-06-15 02:16:18.872222	2026-06-16 05:16:37.458985
DQ_001	DQ Adjustment	dq_adjustment	government_agreed_price - market_price	DQ = Deduction Quantity (Cambodia Customs-specific adjustment factor between one company and the government). Not a standard international term.	["government_agreed_price", "market_price"]	t	2	2026-01-01	\N	2026-06-15 02:16:18.872222	2026-07-31 12:10:25.513
CPP_BASE	CPP Base (Declared Value basis)	petroleum_cpp_base	(dv * exchange_rate * net_mass) / 1000	CPP base = (DV per ton x exchange_rate x net_mass_kg) / 1000. DV = Deduction Value (fair market price per metric ton).	["dv", "exchange_rate", "net_mass"]	t	2	2026-01-01	\N	2026-06-15 02:16:18.872222	2026-07-31 12:10:25.513
ETR_001	Export Tax on Rubber (ETR)	rubber_etr	(dv_total_khr / net_mass_kg) * et_rate	ETR = Export Tax on Rubber. Per-kg rate applied to DV (Deduction Value) total. VAT does NOT apply on rubber exports.	["dv_total_khr", "net_mass_kg", "et_rate"]	t	2	2026-01-01	\N	2026-06-15 02:16:18.872222	2026-07-31 12:10:25.513
PF_001	Petroleum Phase 1	petroleum	cpp_amount + atp_amount + spp_amount + vpp_amount	Petroleum Phase 1 Total = CPP + ATP + SPP + VPP. Importer always pays Phase 1 total. DPP is informational only.	{"variables": ["cpp", "atp", "spp", "vpp", "dpp"]}	f	1	2023-07-01	\N	2026-06-11 08:35:55.220044	2026-08-11 10:37:49.98464
PF_002	Petroleum Phase 2	petroleum	cpp2_amount + atp2_amount + spp2_amount + vpp2_amount	Petroleum Phase 2 Total = CPP2 + ATP2 + SPP2 + VPP2. Same formulas as Phase 1 but CPP base = actual CIF value.	{"variables": ["cpp2", "atp2", "spp2", "vpp2"]}	f	1	2023-07-01	\N	2026-06-11 08:35:55.222984	2026-08-11 10:37:49.98464
VPP_BASE_002	VPP Base Phase 1 (002)	petroleum_vpp_base	SPP_base + SPP	Phase 1 VPP base for high-cost petroleum. SPP_base + SPP_amount. No rounding.	["SPP_base", "SPP"]	t	1	\N	\N	2026-08-11 10:57:51.683409	2026-08-11 10:57:51.683409
VPP_002	VPP Amount Phase 1 (002)	petroleum_vpp	VPP_base * vat_rate	Phase 1 VPP for high-cost petroleum. VPP_base × vat_rate. Rounding: CEILING_100.	["VPP_base", "vat_rate"]	t	1	\N	\N	2026-08-11 10:57:51.871932	2026-08-11 10:57:51.871932
PF_003	Petroleum Phase 1 Total (002)	petroleum_phase1_total	CPP + ATP + SPP + VPP	Phase 1 total for high-cost petroleum. CPP + ATP + SPP + VPP. Importer always pays this total.	["CPP", "ATP", "SPP", "VPP"]	t	1	\N	\N	2026-08-11 10:57:52.19873	2026-08-11 10:57:52.19873
CPP_BASE2_002	CPP Base Phase 2 (002)	petroleum_cpp_base2	CIF_USD * ex_rate	Phase 2 CPP base for high-cost petroleum. Actual CIF converted to KHR. Rounding: ROUND_WHOLE.	["CIF_USD", "ex_rate"]	t	1	\N	\N	2026-08-11 10:57:52.391931	2026-08-11 10:57:52.391931
CPP2_002	CPP Amount Phase 2 (002)	petroleum_cpp2	CPP_base2 * cd_rate	Phase 2 CPP for high-cost petroleum. CPP_base2 × cd_rate. Rounding: CEILING_100.	["CPP_base2", "cd_rate"]	t	1	\N	\N	2026-08-11 10:57:52.594781	2026-08-11 10:57:52.594781
CPP_BASE_002	CPP Base Phase 1 (002)	petroleum_cpp_base	(DV * ex_rate * net_mass_kg) / 1000	Phase 1 CPP base for high-cost petroleum. DV/ton × exchange_rate × net_mass_kg ÷ 1000. Rounding: ROUND_WHOLE.	["DV", "ex_rate", "net_mass_kg"]	t	1	\N	\N	2026-08-11 10:57:50.383792	2026-08-11 10:57:50.383792
CPP_002	CPP Amount Phase 1 (002)	petroleum_cpp	CPP_base * cd_rate	Phase 1 CPP for high-cost petroleum. CPP_base × cd_rate. Rounding: CEILING_100 (round to whole, then UP to nearest 100).	["CPP_base", "cd_rate"]	t	1	\N	\N	2026-08-11 10:57:50.647454	2026-08-11 10:57:50.647454
ATP_002	ATP Amount Phase 1 (002)	petroleum_atp	volume_ltr * atp_rate * ex_rate	Phase 1 ATP for high-cost petroleum. volume_ltr × atp_rate ($/L) × ex_rate. Rounding: CEILING_100.	["volume_ltr", "atp_rate", "ex_rate"]	t	1	\N	\N	2026-08-11 10:57:50.850712	2026-08-11 10:57:50.850712
SPP_BASE_002	SPP Base Phase 1 (002)	petroleum_spp_base	CPP_base + CPP + ATP	Phase 1 SPP base for high-cost petroleum. CPP_base + CPP_amount + ATP_amount. No rounding.	["CPP_base", "CPP", "ATP"]	t	1	\N	\N	2026-08-11 10:57:51.098213	2026-08-11 10:57:51.098213
SPP_002	SPP Amount Phase 1 (002)	petroleum_spp	SPP_base * st_rate * dq_factor	Phase 1 SPP for high-cost petroleum. SPP_base × st_rate × dq_factor. Rounding: CEILING_100.	["SPP_base", "st_rate", "dq_factor"]	t	1	\N	\N	2026-08-11 10:57:51.47459	2026-08-11 10:57:51.47459
